### Important Definitions and Comparisons

| Term               | Description                                                                                                          |
|--------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Hexadecimal Color   | A 6-digit code representing colors in base-16, e.g., `#RRGGBB`.                                                     |
| RGB Color          | Color defined by Red, Green, Blue components, each from 0 to 255.                                                    |
| HSL Color          | Color defined by Hue (0–360°), Saturation (%), and Lightness (%), useful for adjusting color intensity and shade.     |
| Alpha Channel (A)  | Represents opacity in color formats RGBA/HSLA; 0 = fully transparent, 1 = fully opaque.                              |
| `<q>` Tag          | Inline quotation tag which automatically adds quotation marks.                                                      |
| `<blockquote>` Tag | Block quotation tag used for longer quotes; supports `cite` attribute for source reference.                         |
| CSS Inline Style   | CSS code applied directly to an HTML element using the `style` attribute; lowest maintainability.                     |
| CSS External File  | Separate `.css` file linked to HTML for reusable and maintainable styles; recommended approach.                       |
| `dir` Attribute    | Defines text direction (`ltr` or `rtl`), critical for supporting bidirectional languages.                            |

